          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Wasshoi! Wasshoi!"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Frequency: 1/round\n\nThe night parade dances with wild abandon, unintentionally striking nearby creatures. It deals damage to each adjacent creature (41 basic Reflex save), and any creature that fails its save is pushed 10 feet in any direction as the night parade bounces it overhead. The damage depends on the number of actions.\n\n1A 1d10+7 bludgeoning damage\n\n2A 4d10+14 bludgeoning damage\n\n3A 6d10+14 bludgeoning damage"
            },
